# s68 deterministic entry: anchor to demo commit (0244=34), then post-demo
# interactive title (1506=160), then a FRESH Start HOLD (edge lands at title,
# held span covers the 5D4==0F service window). s67's hold-from-boot committed
# 0244 via 5AAC but its edge was consumed pre-title, so the title supervisor
# never exited -> hybrid title-display/level-controller state. An 8f PRESS at
# title (s68b) gave the edge but missed the 5D4 window -> no commit.
WAIT_RAM16 0xFF0244 0x0034
WAIT_RAM16 0xFF1506 0x0160
WAIT 30
HOLD START
WAIT_RAM16 0xFF0244 0x0001
RELEASE
WAIT 500
HOLD RIGHT
WAIT 600
DUMP_RAM S:\home\dev\boogerman-pc\native\captures-us\s68d\right.bin
SCREENSHOT S:\home\dev\boogerman-pc\native\captures-us\s68d\right.png
RELEASE
EXIT
